{"data":[{"author_id":"1786121413767938048","created_at":"2026-10-19T22:13:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112306243025191395"],"id":"2112306243025191395","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":452,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"虚云老和尚（四）：一只茶杯落地，他等了三十多年\n虚云老和尚五十六岁那年，发生了他一生中最重要的一件事。\n\n这一年是光绪二十一年，1895年。扬州高旻寺准备连续打十二个禅七，虚云也准备前往。可他还没有走到高旻寺，差一点就死在了长江里。","url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2112306243025191395"},{"author_id":"1786121413767938048","created_at":"2026-10-19T23:19:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112322727407448135"],"id":"2112322727407448135","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":485,"like_count":7,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"虚云老和尚（五）：一生只梦见母亲一次\n\n虚云老和尚五十八岁那年，又想起了自己的母亲。\n他出生时，母亲颜氏便去世了。从出生到长大，他从未真正见过母亲的面容。四十三岁时，他为了报母恩，从普陀山出发，三步一拜，走了近两年拜到五台山。\n可十五年过去，这件事仍然没有从他心里放下。","url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2112322727407448135"},{"article":{"title":"费拉德尔菲亚之梦"},"author_id":"1905849771014901760","created_at":"2026-10-19T22:13:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112306197965480205"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2112…","end":37,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2112294904739266560","start":14,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2112294904739266560","url":"https://t.co/GObMR1gRGH"}]},"id":"2112306197965480205","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3420,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"或许会再见，费拉德尔菲亚。 https://t.co/GObMR1gRGH","url":"https://x.com/LucretianDelta/status/2112306197965480205"},{"article":{"title":"【CDT周报】第286期：你没有收入，不重要；你不交社保！对我很重要！"},"author_id":"85875473","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:04:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112334188921958859"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2112…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2112333973057929216","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2112333973057929216","url":"https://t.co/0UnDzhFEsg"}]},"id":"2112334188921958859","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":16577,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"https://t.co/0UnDzhFEsg","url":"https://x.com/CDTChinese/status/2112334188921958859"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1786121413767938048","name":"Tyler X","username":"Tylertruthfx"},{"id":"1905849771014901760","name":"墙","username":"LucretianDelta"},{"id":"85875473","name":"中国数字时代","username":"CDTChinese"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2112334188921958859","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlweje8miy9nl0bl6e06ij5oldod","oldest_id":"2112306197965480205","result_count":4}}